actly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-full-support-catalogue"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-full-support-catalogue"],"id":"long.thm-full-support-catalogue","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.14 (Erdős–Borwein full-support irrationality, unconditional)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.14, p. 48, label thm:full-support-catalogue","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For every integer $b\\ge2$, the sum $\\sum_{n\\ge1}(b^n-1)^{-1}$ is irrational. This is Erdős’s theorem \\[erdos1948\\]; at base $2$ the sum is the Erdős–Borwein constant. The result concerns full support, not all its infinite subsets.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support-catalogue%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.thm-full-support-catalogue%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.irrational_erdosSum_full_support"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.thm-full-support-catalogue","id":"field:26f2fd815b53c8f60156b455d4d8b2519303be7a19c4278a577bf3a98bcc6020","kind":"citation_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.thm-